    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d249-a3">

                <pb facs="0400" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg306"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Cablegram.].</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 10,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">To <hi rendition="#small-caps">Father Justin</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Manhattan College, New York:</hi></p>
                <p>French laws allow no public investigation in case of confinement on ground of
                    lunacy; best chance securing release through action our minister, who is anxious
                    to be of service, but requires instructions. Get Bayard cable him authorizing
                    him to ask French Government deliver Seillière to ours; procurator says French
                    Government would probably make no objections.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kelly</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Counsel of United Stales Legation.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
